# Go
*.exe
*.exe~
*.dll
*.dylib
*.test
*.out
go.work
vendor/
# `*.test` above is Go's compiled per-package test binary (go test -c). The
# container test images are named Dockerfile.test / Dockerfile.test-typescript,
# so negate those back in.
!Dockerfile.test
!Dockerfile.test-*

# k6 — built xk6 binary lives at repo root after `xk6 build`. The
# anchored slashes scope the ignore so examples/k6/ + integrations/k6/
# aren't swallowed.
/xk6
/k6

